    "detailed_description": "Forkore is a friendly restaurant management game where your aim is to run a successful business, and at the same time maintain a good relationship with the local community!<br><br>You\u2019ve bought your best friend's run-down restaurant in Clementine, so you move there with the scope of reviving the long-forgotten, but still magical place.<br><br>You leave your city with a few coins and with the hope of beginning a new life full of adventures and opportunities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Managing a business</h2><br>Turn your old restaurant into a major tourist destination. Learn the habits of your guests and capitalize on them!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Spend your money wisely and be thoughtful because your restaurant\u2019s reputation is the key for success.</li></ul><br>If you make wrong decisions, your business will feel the consequences. Be wise, and your place will blossom in no time!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aiming for progression</h2><br>Make your restaurant stand out by creating a unique atmosphere for your guests!<br><br>Progressing in Forklore will let you discover new areas:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Learn new recipes, buy a building contract, renovate your restaurant, or acquire rare items, like jukebox CDs!</li><li>New skills and power-ups are also important, since they have an impact on your efficiency and day-to-day life.</li></ul><br>Along your journey, you will unlock a lot of new perks, and you will learn how to combine them in a way that maximizes their advantages!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Being part of a community</h2><br>Clementine\u2019s residents are eager to meet you. Some of them were good friends with your grandmother, some of them are just as young as you!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are over ten locals in Clementine, and you can learn something from each one of them. Humans are different: they have unique personalities, interesting habits, and weird quirks! </li></ul><br> Who will be your best friend in Clementine? Maybe you\u2019ll learn new stuff about your grandparents, too!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Organizing your life</h2><br>Take some time out for yourself and restore your energy. Go fishing, chill out in the park or chat with the locals, because there\u2019s more to life than work. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go to sleep in time, so the next day you won\u2019t feel exhausted. Catch rare fish and create expensive, special meals. Visit the church on Sundays, maybe consider donating.</li></ul><br>Live your own life, follow your goals and progress in your own pace. Every step you take will make a difference, that\u2019s for sure!<br><br>Trailer music by: Crusaderp",
    "about_the_game": "Forkore is a friendly restaurant management game where your aim is to run a successful business, and at the same time maintain a good relationship with the local community!<br><br>You\u2019ve bought your best friend's run-down restaurant in Clementine, so you move there with the scope of reviving the long-forgotten, but still magical place.<br><br>You leave your city with a few coins and with the hope of beginning a new life full of adventures and opportunities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Managing a business</h2><br>Turn your old restaurant into a major tourist destination. Learn the habits of your guests and capitalize on them!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Spend your money wisely and be thoughtful because your restaurant\u2019s reputation is the key for success.</li></ul><br>If you make wrong decisions, your business will feel the consequences. Be wise, and your place will blossom in no time!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aiming for progression</h2><br>Make your restaurant stand out by creating a unique atmosphere for your guests!<br><br>Progressing in Forklore will let you discover new areas:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Learn new recipes, buy a building contract, renovate your restaurant, or acquire rare items, like jukebox CDs!</li><li>New skills and power-ups are also important, since they have an impact on your efficiency and day-to-day life.</li></ul><br>Along your journey, you will unlock a lot of new perks, and you will learn how to combine them in a way that maximizes their advantages!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Being part of a community</h2><br>Clementine\u2019s residents are eager to meet you. Some of them were good friends with your grandmother, some of them are just as young as you!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There are over ten locals in Clementine, and you can learn something from each one of them. Humans are different: they have unique personalities, interesting habits, and weird quirks! </li></ul><br> Who will be your best friend in Clementine? Maybe you\u2019ll learn new stuff about your grandparents, too!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Organizing your life</h2><br>Take some time out for yourself and restore your energy. Go fishing, chill out in the park or chat with the locals, because there\u2019s more to life than work. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go to sleep in time, so the next day you won\u2019t feel exhausted. Catch rare fish and create expensive, special meals. Visit the church on Sundays, maybe consider donating.</li></ul><br>Live your own life, follow your goals and progress in your own pace. Every step you take will make a difference, that\u2019s for sure!<br><br>Trailer music by: Crusaderp",
    "short_description": "Escape to the charming village of Clementine and breathe new life into your best friend's old, run-down restaurant. With hard work, creativity, and a little help from the locals, you can transform it into a thriving business!",
